Terminals unused in grammar

    UnqualifiedMethodIdentifier
    NUMBER
    TRAILING_COMMA
    LT_RelationalExpression
    RBRACK


Grammar

    0 $accept: CompilationUnit $end

    1 IdentifierComplement: VAR_IdentifierComplement
    2                     | SEALED_IdentifierComplement
    3                     | NON_SEALED_IdentifierComplement
    4                     | YIELD_IdentifierComplement

    5 IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator
    6                            | VAR_MethodDeclarator
    7                            | YIELD_MethodDeclarator

    8 IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers
    9                                 | VAR_AnnotationIdentifiers
   10                                 | YIELD_AnnotationIdentifiers

   11 Literal: INTEGERLITERAL
   12        | FLOATINGPOINTLITERAL
   13        | TRUE
   14        | FALSE
   15        | CHARACTERLITERAL
   16        | STRINGLITERAL
   17        | TextBlock
   18        | MY_NULL

   19 Modifier: Annotation_Modifier
   20         | PUBLIC
   21         | PROTECTED
   22         | PRIVATE
   23         | ABSTRACT
   24         | STATIC
   25         | FINAL
   26         | STRICTFP
   27         | TRANSIENT
   28         | VOLATILE
   29         | SYNCHRONIZED
   30         | NATIVE
   31         | DEFAULT
   32         | SEALED
   33         | NON_SEALED

   34 Modifiers: Modifier
   35          | Modifiers Modifier

   36 Annotation_Modifier: NormalAnnotation_Modifier
   37                    | MarkerAnnotation_Modifier
   38                    | SingleElementAnnotation_Modifier

   39 NormalAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
   40                          | AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

   41 MarkerAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName

   42 SingleElementAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

   43 TypeName_ModifierOrDims: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator
   44                        | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator

   45 PrimitiveType: Annotations UnannPrimitiveType

   46 NumericType: IntegralType
   47            | FloatingPointType

   48 IntegralType: BYTE
   49             | SHORT
   50             | INT
   51             | LONG
   52             | CHAR

   53 FloatingPointType: FLOAT
   54                  | DOUBLE

   55 ReferenceType: ClassOrInterfaceType
   56              | ArrayType

   57 ClassOrInterfaceType: UnannClassOrInterfaceType
   58                     | Annotations UnannClassOrInterfaceType

   59 ArrayType: Annotations UnannPrimitiveType Dims
   60          | Annotations UnannClassOrInterfaceType Dims
   61          | UnannArrayType

   62 Dims: Annotations_Dims '[' ']'
   63     | Annotations_Dims '[' ']' Dims
   64     | '[' ']'
   65     | '[' ']' Dims

   66 Annotation_Dims: NormalAnnotation_Dims
   67                | MarkerAnnotation_Dims
   68                | SingleElementAnnotation_Dims

   69 Annotations_Dims: Annotations_Dims Annotation_Dims
   70                 | Annotation_Dims

   71 NormalAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
   72                      | AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

   73 MarkerAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName

   74 SingleElementAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

   75 TypeParameter: Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   76              | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeBound
   77              | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   78              | TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeBound

   79 TypeBound: EXTENDS ClassOrInterfaceType AdditionalBounds

   80 AdditionalBounds: AdditionalBounds AMPERSAND ClassOrInterfaceType
   81                 | %empty

   82 TypeArguments: '<' TypeArgumentList '>'
   83              | LANGLE TypeArgumentList '>'

   84 TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType: LANGLE TypeArgumentList '>'

   85 TypeArgumentList: TypeArgument
   86                 | TypeArgumentList ',' TypeArgument

   87 TypeArgument: ReferenceType
   88             | Wildcard

   89 Wildcard: Annotations '?' WildcardBounds
   90         | Annotations '?'
   91         | '?' WildcardBounds
   92         | '?'

   93 WildcardBounds: EXTENDS ReferenceType
   94               | SUPER ReferenceType

   95 ModuleName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   96           | IdentifierComplement
   97           | ModuleName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   98           | ModuleName DOT_CommonName IdentifierComplement

   99 ModuleNames: ModuleName
  100            | ModuleNames ',' ModuleName

  101 TypeName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  102         | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER

  103 TypeNames: TypeName
  104          | TypeNames ',' TypeName

  105 CommonName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  106           | IdentifierComplement
  107           | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  108           | CommonName DOT_CommonName IdentifierComplement

  109 CompilationUnit: OrdinaryCompilationUnit
  110                | ModularCompilationUnit

  111 OrdinaryCompilationUnit: PackageDeclaration ImportDeclarations TypeDeclarations
  112                        | ImportDeclarations TypeDeclarations
  113                        | PackageDeclaration TypeDeclarations
  114                        | TypeDeclarations

  115 ModularCompilationUnit: ImportDeclarations ModuleDeclaration
  116                       | ModuleDeclaration

  117 PackageDeclaration: Annotations PACKAGE CommonName ';'
  118                   | PACKAGE CommonName ';'

  119 ImportDeclarations: ImportDeclaration
  120                   | ImportDeclarations ImportDeclaration

  121 ImportDeclaration: SingleTypeImportDeclaration
  122                  | TypeImportOnDemandDeclaration
  123                  | SingleStaticImportDeclaration
  124                  | StaticImportOnDemandDeclaration

  125 SingleTypeImportDeclaration: IMPORT TypeName ';'

  126 TypeImportOnDemandDeclaration: IMPORT CommonName '.' '*' ';'

  127 SingleStaticImportDeclaration: IMPORT STATIC CommonName ';'

  128 StaticImportOnDemandDeclaration: IMPORT STATIC CommonName '.' '*' ';'

  129 TypeDeclarations: TypeDeclaration
  130                 | TypeDeclarations TypeDeclaration

  131 TypeDeclaration: ClassDeclaration
  132                | InterfaceDeclaration
  133                | EMPTY_STMT
  134                | ';'

  135 ModuleDeclaration: Annotations OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  136                  | Annotations MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  137                  | OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  138                  | MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  139                  | Annotations OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  140                  | Annotations MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  141                  | OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  142                  | MODULE CommonName '{' '}'

  143 ModuleDirectives: ModuleDirective
  144                 | ModuleDirectives ModuleDirective

  145 ModuleDirective: REQUIRES TRANSITIVE ModuleName ';'
  146                | REQUIRES ModuleName ';'
  147                | REQUIRES STATIC ModuleName ';'
  148                | EXPORTS CommonName ';'
  149                | EXPORTS CommonName TO ModuleNames ';'
  150                | OPENS CommonName ';'
  151                | OPENS CommonName TO ModuleNames ';'
  152                | USES TypeName ';'
  153                | PROVIDES TypeName WITH TypeNames ';'

  154 ArrayInitializer: '{' VariableInitializerList '}'
  155                 | '{' VariableInitializerList ',' '}'
  156                 | '{' '}'

  157 VariableInitializerList: VariableInitializer
  158                        | VariableInitializerList ',' VariableInitializer

  159 ClassDeclaration: NormalClassDeclaration
  160                 | EnumDeclaration

  161 NormalClassDeclaration: Modifiers CLASS TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptSuperclass OptSuperinterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits ClassBody
  162                       | CLASS TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptSuperclass OptSuperinterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits ClassBody

  163 OptTypeParameters: TypeParameters
  164                  | %empty

  165 OptSuperclass: Superclass
  166              | %empty

  167 OptSuperinterfaces: Superinterfaces
  168                   | %empty

  169 OptClassOrInterfacePermits: ClassOrInterfacePermits
  170                           | %empty

  171 TypeParameters: '<' TypeParameterList '>'
  172               | LANGLE TypeParameterList '>'

  173 TypeParameterList: TypeParameter
  174                  | TypeParameterList ',' TypeParameter

  175 Superclass: EXTENDS ClassOrInterfaceType

  176 Superinterfaces: IMPLEMENTS InterfaceTypeList

  177 InterfaceTypeList: ClassOrInterfaceType
  178                  | InterfaceTypeList ',' ClassOrInterfaceType

  179 ClassOrInterfacePermits: PERMITS TypeNames

  180 ClassBody: '{' ClassBodyDeclarationList '}'
  181          | '{' '}'

  182 ClassBodyDeclarationList: ClassBodyDeclaration
  183                         | ClassBodyDeclarationList ClassBodyDeclaration

  184 ClassBodyDeclaration: ClassMemberDeclaration
  185                     | InstanceInitializer
  186                     | StaticInitializer
  187                     | ConstructorDeclaration

  188 ClassMemberDeclaration: FieldDeclaration
  189                       | MethodDeclaration
  190                       | ClassDeclaration
  191                       | InterfaceDeclaration
  192                       | ';'
  193                       | EMPTY_STMT

  194 FieldDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'
  195                 | UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'

  196 VariableDeclaratorList: VariableDeclarator
  197                       | VariableDeclaratorList ',' VariableDeclarator

  198 VariableDeclarator: VariableDeclaratorId '=' VariableInitializer
  199                   | VariableDeclaratorId

  200 VariableDeclaratorId: TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  201                     | IdentifierComplement Dims
  202                     | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  203                     | IdentifierComplement

  204 VariableInitializer: Expression
  205                    | ArrayInitializer

  206 UnannType: UnannReferenceType
  207          | UnannPrimitiveType

  208 UnannPrimitiveType: NumericType
  209                   | BOOLEAN

  210 UnannReferenceType: UnannArrayType
  211                   | UnannClassOrInterfaceType

  212 UnannClassOrInterfaceType: TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  213                          | CommonName
  214                          | CommonName '.' Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  215                          | CommonName '.' Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  216                          | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  217                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  218                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  219                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType

  220 UnannArrayType: UnannPrimitiveType Dims
  221               | UnannClassOrInterfaceType Dims

  222 MethodDeclaration: Modifiers MethodHeader MethodBody
  223                  | MethodHeader MethodBody

  224 MethodHeader: Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  225             | Result MethodDeclarator
  226             | TypeParameters Annotations Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  227             | TypeParameters Annotations Result MethodDeclarator
  228             | TypeParameters Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  229             | TypeParameters Result MethodDeclarator

  230 Result: UnannType
  231       | VOID

  232 MethodDeclarator: IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')' Dims
  233                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ')' Dims
  234                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' FormalParameterList ')' Dims
  235                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims
  236                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  237                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ')'
  238                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  239                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')'

  240 ReceiverParameter: Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' THIS
  241                  | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement '.' THIS
  242                  | Annotations UnannType THIS
  243                  | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' THIS
  244                  | UnannType IdentifierComplement '.' THIS
  245                  | UnannType THIS

  246 FormalParameterList: FormalParameter
  247                    | FormalParameter ',' FormalParameterList

  248 FormalParameter: VariableModifiers UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  249                | Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  250                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  251                | VariableModifiers UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  252                | Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  253                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  254                | VariableModifiers UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  255                | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  256                | UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  257                | VariableModifiers UnannType IdentifierComplement
  258                | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement
  259                | UnannType IdentifierComplement
  260                | VariableArityParameter
  261                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  262                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' TYPE_IDENTIFIER

  263 VariableArityParameter: VariableModifiers UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  264                       | VariableModifiers UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  265                       | Annotations UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  266                       | Annotations UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  267                       | UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  268                       | UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  269                       | VariableModifiers UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  270                       | VariableModifiers UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  271                       | Annotations UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  272                       | Annotations UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  273                       | UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  274                       | UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement

  275 VariableModifiers: FINAL
  276                  | Annotations FINAL
  277                  | FINAL Annotations
  278                  | Annotations FINAL Annotations

  279 Throws: THROWS ExceptionTypeList

  280 ExceptionTypeList: ExceptionType
  281                  | ExceptionTypeList ',' ExceptionType

  282 ExceptionType: ClassOrInterfaceType

  283 MethodBody: Block
  284           | ';'

  285 InstanceInitializer: Block

  286 StaticInitializer: STATIC Block

  287 ConstructorDeclaration: Modifiers ConstructorDeclarator Throws ConstructorBody
  288                       | Modifiers ConstructorDeclarator ConstructorBody
  289                       | ConstructorDeclarator Throws ConstructorBody
  290                       | ConstructorDeclarator ConstructorBody

  291 ConstructorDeclarator: TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  292                      | TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ')'
  293                      | TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  294                      | TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' ')'
  295                      | SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  296                      | SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ')'
  297                      | SimpleTypeName '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  298                      | SimpleTypeName '(' ')'

  299 SimpleTypeName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator

  300 ConstructorBody: '{' ExplicitConstructorInvocation BlockStatements '}'
  301                | '{' ExplicitConstructorInvocation '}'
  302                | '{' BlockStatements '}'
  303                | '{' '}'

  304 ExplicitConstructorInvocation: TypeArguments THIS '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  305                              | TypeArguments THIS '(' ')' ';'
  306                              | THIS '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  307                              | THIS '(' ')' ';'
  308                              | TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  309                              | TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  310                              | SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  311                              | SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  312                              | CommonName '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  313                              | CommonName '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  314                              | CommonName '.' SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  315                              | CommonName '.' SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  316                              | Primary '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  317                              | Primary '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  318                              | Primary '.' SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  319                              | Primary '.' SUPER '(' ')' ';'

  320 EnumDeclaration: Modifiers ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration Superinterfaces EnumBody
  321                | Modifiers ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration EnumBody
  322                | ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration Superinterfaces EnumBody
  323                | ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration EnumBody

  324 EnumBody: '{' EnumConstantList ',' EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  325         | '{' EnumConstantList EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  326         | '{' EnumConstantList '}'
  327         | '{' EnumConstantList ',' '}'
  328         | '{' EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  329         | '{' '}'

  330 EnumConstantList: EnumConstant
  331                 | EnumConstantList ',' EnumConstant

  332 EnumConstant: Annotations SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  333             | Annotations SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')'
  334             | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER ClassBody
  335             | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  336             | SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  337             | SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')'
  338             | TYPE_IDENTIFIER ClassBody
  339             | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  340             | Annotations IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  341             | Annotations IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')'
  342             | Annotations IdentifierComplement ClassBody
  343             | Annotations IdentifierComplement
  344             | IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  345             | IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')'
  346             | IdentifierComplement ClassBody
  347             | IdentifierComplement

  348 EnumBodyDeclarations: ';' ClassBodyDeclarationList

  349 InterfaceDeclaration: NormalInterfaceDeclaration
  350                     | AnnotationTypeDeclaration

  351 NormalInterfaceDeclaration: Modifiers INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptExtendsInterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits InterfaceBody
  352                           | INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptExtendsInterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits InterfaceBody

  353 ExtendsInterfaces: EXTENDS InterfaceTypeList

  354 OptExtendsInterfaces: ExtendsInterfaces
  355                     | %empty

  356 InterfaceBody: '{' InterfaceMemberDeclarationList '}'
  357              | '{' '}'

  358 InterfaceMemberDeclarationList: InterfaceMemberDeclaration
  359                               | InterfaceMemberDeclarationList InterfaceMemberDeclaration

  360 InterfaceMemberDeclaration: ConstantDeclaration
  361                           | InterfaceMethodDeclaration
  362                           | ClassDeclaration
  363                           | InterfaceDeclaration
  364                           | ';'
  365                           | EMPTY_STMT

  366 ConstantDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'
  367                    | UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'

  368 InterfaceMethodDeclaration: Modifiers MethodHeader MethodBody
  369                           | MethodHeader MethodBody

  370 AnnotationTypeDeclaration: Modifiers AT_AnnotationTypeDeclaration INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  371                          | AT_AnnotationTypeDeclaration INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  372                          | Modifiers AT_Modifier INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  373                          | AT_Modifier INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  374                          | Modifiers '@' INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  375                          | '@' INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody

  376 AnnotationTypeBody: '{' AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList '}'
  377                   | '{' '}'

  378 AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList: AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration
  379                                    | AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration

  380 AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration: AnnotationTypeElementDeclaration
  381                                | ConstantDeclaration
  382                                | ClassDeclaration
  383                                | InterfaceDeclaration
  384                                | ';'
  385                                | EMPTY_STMT

  386 AnnotationTypeElementDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims DefaultValue ';'
  387                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims ';'
  388                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' DefaultValue ';'
  389                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' ';'
  390                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims DefaultValue ';'
  391                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims ';'
  392                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' DefaultValue ';'
  393                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' ';'

  394 DefaultValue: DEFAULT ElementValue

  395 Annotation: NormalAnnotation
  396           | MarkerAnnotation
  397           | SingleElementAnnotation

  398 Annotations: Annotations Annotation
  399            | Annotation

  400 NormalAnnotation: '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
  401                 | '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

  402 ElementValuePairList: ElementValuePair
  403                     | ElementValuePairList ',' ElementValuePair

  404 ElementValuePair: TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' ElementValue
  405                 | IdentifierComplement '=' ElementValue

  406 ElementValue: ConditionalExpression
  407             | ElementValueArrayInitializer
  408             | Annotation

  409 ElementValueArrayInitializer: '{' ElementValueList ',' '}'
  410                             | '{' ElementValueList '}'
  411                             | '{' '}'

  412 ElementValueList: ElementValue
  413                 | ElementValueList ',' ElementValue

  414 MarkerAnnotation: '@' TypeName

  415 SingleElementAnnotation: '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

  416 Block: '{' BlockStatements '}'
  417      | '{' '}'

  418 BlockStatements: BlockStatement
  419                | BlockStatements BlockStatement

  420 BlockStatement: LocalVariableDeclarationStatement
  421               | LocalClassOrInterfaceDeclaration
  422               | Statement

  423 LocalVariableDeclarationStatement: LocalVariableDeclaration ';'

  424 LocalVariableDeclaration: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList
  425                         | Annotations LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList
  426                         | LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList

  427 LocalVariableType: UnannType
  428                  | VAR

  429 LocalClassOrInterfaceDeclaration: ClassDeclaration
  430                                 | NormalInterfaceDeclaration

  431 Statement: StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement
  432          | LabeledStatement
  433          | IfThenStatement
  434          | IfThenElseStatement
  435          | WhileStatement
  436          | ForStatement

  437 StatementNoShortIf: StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement
  438                   | LabeledStatementNoShortIf
  439                   | IfThenElseStatementNoShortIf
  440                   | WhileStatementNoShortIf
  441                   | ForStatementNoShortIf

  442 StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement: Block
  443                                     | EmptyStatement
  444                                     | ExpressionStatement
  445                                     | AssertStatement
  446                                     | SwitchStatement
  447                                     | DoStatement
  448                                     | BreakStatement
  449                                     | ContinueStatement
  450                                     | ReturnStatement
  451                                     | SynchronizedStatement
  452                                     | ThrowStatement
  453                                     | TryStatement
  454                                     | YieldStatement

  455 EmptyStatement: EMPTY_STMT
  456               | ';'

  457 LabeledStatement: TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Statement
  458                 | IdentifierComplement ':' Statement

  459 LabeledStatementNoShortIf: TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' StatementNoShortIf
  460                          | IdentifierComplement ':' StatementNoShortIf

  461 ExpressionStatement: StatementExpression ';'

  462 StatementExpression: Assignment
  463                    | PreIncrementExpression
  464                    | PreDecrementExpression
  465                    | PostIncrementExpression
  466                    | PostDecrementExpression
  467                    | MethodInvocation
  468                    | ClassInstanceCreationExpression

  469 IfThenStatement: IF '(' Expression ')' Statement

  470 IfThenElseStatement: IF '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf ELSE Statement

  471 IfThenElseStatementNoShortIf: IF '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf ELSE StatementNoShortIf

  472 AssertStatement: ASSERT Expression ';'
  473                | ASSERT Expression ':' Expression ';'

  474 SwitchStatement: SWITCH '(' Expression ')' SwitchBlock

  475 SwitchBlock: '{' SwitchRules '}'
  476            | '{' SwitchBlockStatementGroups '}'
  477            | '{' '}'

  478 SwitchRule: SwitchLabel ARROW Expression ';'
  479           | SwitchLabel ARROW Block
  480           | SwitchLabel ARROW ThrowStatement

  481 SwitchRules: SwitchRule
  482            | SwitchRules SwitchRule

  483 SwitchBlockStatementGroup: SwitchLabels BlockStatements

  484 SwitchBlockStatementGroups: SwitchBlockStatementGroup
  485                           | SwitchBlockStatementGroups SwitchBlockStatementGroup

  486 SwitchLabel: CASE CaseConstants
  487            | DEFAULT_SwitchLabel

  488 SwitchLabels: SwitchLabel ':'
  489             | SwitchLabels SwitchLabel ':'

  490 CaseConstant: ConditionalExpression

  491 CaseConstants: CaseConstant
  492              | CaseConstants ',' CaseConstant

  493 WhileStatement: WHILE '(' Expression ')' Statement

  494 WhileStatementNoShortIf: WHILE '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf

  495 DoStatement: DO Statement WHILE '(' Expression ')' ';'

  496 ForStatement: BasicForStatement
  497             | EnhancedForStatement

  498 ForStatementNoShortIf: BasicForStatementNoShortIf
  499                      | EnhancedForStatementNoShortIf

  500 BasicForStatement: FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  501                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ')' Statement
  502                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  503                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ')' Statement
  504                  | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  505                  | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ')' Statement
  506                  | FOR '(' ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  507                  | FOR '(' ';' ';' ')' Statement

  508 BasicForStatementNoShortIf: FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  509                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  510                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  511                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  512                           | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  513                           | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  514                           | FOR '(' ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  515                           | FOR '(' ';' ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf

  516 ForInit: StatementExpressionList
  517        | LocalVariableDeclaration

  518 ForUpdate: StatementExpressionList

  519 StatementExpressionList: StatementExpression
  520                        | StatementExpressionList ',' StatementExpression

  521 EnhancedForStatement: FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  522                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  523                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  524                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  525                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  526                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  527                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  528                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  529                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  530                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement
  531                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement
  532                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement

  533 EnhancedForStatementNoShortIf: FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  534                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  535                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  536                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  537                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  538                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  539                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  540                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  541                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  542                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  543                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  544                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf

  545 BreakStatement: BREAK TYPE_IDENTIFIER ';'
  546               | BREAK IdentifierComplement ';'
  547               | BREAK ';'

  548 YieldStatement: YIELD Expression ';'

  549 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE ';'
  550                  | CONTINUE TYPE_IDENTIFIER ';'
  551                  | CONTINUE IdentifierComplement ';'

  552 ReturnStatement: RETURN Expression ';'
  553                | RETURN ';'

  554 ThrowStatement: THROW Expression ';'

  555 SynchronizedStatement: SYNCHRONIZED '(' Expression ')' Block

  556 TryStatement: TRY Block Catches
  557             | TRY Block Catches Finally
  558             | TRY Block Finally
  559             | TryWithResourcesStatement

  560 Catches: CatchClause
  561        | Catches CatchClause

  562 CatchClause: CATCH '(' CatchFormalParameter ')' Block

  563 CatchFormalParameter: VariableModifiers CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  564                     | Annotations CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  565                     | CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  566                     | VariableModifiers CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  567                     | Annotations CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  568                     | CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  569                     | VariableModifiers CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  570                     | Annotations CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  571                     | CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  572                     | VariableModifiers CatchType IdentifierComplement
  573                     | Annotations CatchType IdentifierComplement
  574                     | CatchType IdentifierComplement

  575 CatchType: UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  576          | CatchType '|' UnannClassOrInterfaceType

  577 Finally: FINALLY Block

  578 TryWithResourcesStatement: TRY ResourceSpecification Block Catches Finally
  579                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block Catches
  580                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block Finally
  581                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block

  582 ResourceSpecification: '(' ResourceList ')'
  583                      | '(' ResourceList ';' ')'

  584 ResourceList: Resource
  585             | ResourceList ';' Resource

  586 Resource: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  587         | Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  588         | LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  589         | VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  590         | Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  591         | LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  592         | VariableAccess

  593 VariableAccess: CommonName
  594               | FieldAccess

  595 Pattern: TypePattern

  596 TypePattern: LocalVariableDeclaration_TypePattern

  597 LocalVariableDeclaration_TypePattern: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator
  598                                     | Annotations LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator
  599                                     | LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator

  600 Primary: PrimaryNoNewArray
  601        | ArrayCreationExpression

  602 PrimaryNoNewArray: Literal
  603                  | ClassLiteral
  604                  | THIS
  605                  | CommonName '.' THIS
  606                  | '(' Expression ')'
  607                  | ClassInstanceCreationExpression
  608                  | FieldAccess
  609                  | ArrayAccess
  610                  | MethodInvocation
  611                  | MethodReference

  612 ClassLiteral: CommonName DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  613             | NumericType DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  614             | BOOLEAN DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  615             | CommonName '.' CLASS
  616             | NumericType '.' CLASS
  617             | BOOLEAN '.' CLASS
  618             | VOID '.' CLASS

